msgctxt "512"
msgid "Controls"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Use the "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Down@Cabaret><Action:Button_"
"LS_Left@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Right@Cabaret> to control where Kiryu "
"looks.\r\n"
"This is your big chance to feast your eyes on a perfect incarnation of "
"beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> when you want to focus intently on one "
"of her features. Holding down <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> allows you to "
"focus your gaze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Note that her reaction will change depending on where you look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "(Her eyes are really cute... And they brim with confidence and energy.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "(She has nice lips... at least when complaints aren't flooding out of them.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "(Her hands are so soft... but look at those nails.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "(I like the shape of those legs...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "(What does she have in her hair? Is that a real flower?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "(They're covered up just enough to grab my attention...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "(Hmm... I kind of like the whole package.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "I like your eyes. They give off a powerful impression."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Oooh, tell me more, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "Well... They're just my type, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Aww, thanks. I take care of 'em real good, ya know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"That's how I get my guys in the first place⑬all it takes is one li'l "
"glance! They say the eyes speak volumes without words... or somethin' like "
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Are your eyes saying anything right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"What, can't ya tell? They're sayin' they wanna make ya all woozy and weak "
"in the knees! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Heh. Already halfway there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"You have nice lips. And the way you talk is different than anyone I've ever "
"met."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Yeah? Well, what can I say? I'm just bein' me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "And I respect that about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"Heh... Well... Sometimes I get the feeling that people see me as some sorta "
"character. \"Oh, that must be a Rin thing,\" or, \"Don't ever change, Rin.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"I am aware of my tendency to blurt out whatever I wanna say, when I wanna "
"say it... And maybe I am a bit short with people..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"But hey, that's just who I am. And if you say you like me, that's good "
"enough for me. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Then I'm glad I got to say it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "It'd have to be your hands. They're so clean and pretty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Oh yeah? I think I got pretty nice hands, myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"I put a lot of work into 'em. Particularly the nails. Gotta get those down "
"just right, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Ain't it nice seein' a lady take good care of herself? It's pretty much "
"standard procedure for us to spend all day paintin' our face or choosin' "
"the perfect outfit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid ""
"...Not to mention cleanin' down to the fingertips! That's the sign of a "
"really good woman right there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "I gotta say. You've got some amazing legs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Ooh! So you're goin' down that road, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Yeah. My eyes just seem to wander there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Heheheh... I'm pretty proud of these legs, y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid ""
"A long time ago, some famous fashion designer once said,\r\n"
"\"You know what? We should probably start showing off the\r\n"
"legs of a working lady. That should make us a lot of money.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid ""
"And then, <Italic>boom</Italic>! It was miniskirts and high heels all over "
"the dang place!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"Not that I mind. I know I've got some killer legs. Hope ya got a nice, long "
"look! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "Is that flower in your hair... real?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"Yep, it's the real deal. Got one of my hairdresser friends to do it. Calls "
"it an \"ikebana updo.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "...She updid what now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san! She styled my hair with a flower, that's all! Ain't it gorgeous? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "It sure is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid ""
"Good, 'cause I am absolutely <Italic>in love</Italic> with how it turned "
"out! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "I knew you'd say something like that... judging by that lewd expression."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "That's... not what I was trying to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"You don't gotta bend all backwards tryin' to explain. I get it⑬you're a "
"guy, that's what guys like. I mean, why else would ya be here, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "Hey, you're not even listening..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid ""
"Hahaha... I'm just teasin' ya. I know what assets I got, and I ain't afraid "
"to use 'em. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid ""
"Okay. I'm lettin' it slide this time. But this is your only strike, "
"Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "Yo! Who are you even looking at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Oh... Uh, no one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid ""
"Hey, if you wanna go ogle some other girl, I'd be more than happy to go "
"grab 'em for ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "It's not that... I guess my eyes just wandered off for a second."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "...Well, alright. Long as ya understand. But focus on me right now, 'kay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "(She's looking right at me...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "(She has such nice hair... but also soft lips.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "(Now do I like her hair better... Or her hands?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid "(I know she's proud of her hair... But I prefer those legs.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid "(Her hair really is nice, though.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "(She's got a nice chest. Too bad I can't really see much...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "(I could stare at her all day... But she might not like that.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "You know, it's a little hard to answer when you're staring at me like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid ""
"I don't see the problem with lookin' a guy straight in the eyes. That's "
"what you're supposed to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "Well, yeah, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid ""
"Come on, don't be weak. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> 'Sides, weren't you "
"starin' into my eyes, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid ""
"You're supposed to be admirin' my hair, ya big beef bowl. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "Your hair is nice... But your lips are your best feature."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "Come on... I wanted ya to look at my hair, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid "You really don't listen to people, do ya, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid "I don't?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid ""
"Nope, and that's what's great about ya. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> When a "
"man doesn't listen, it's all the more worth it when they fall for ya. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Your hands are nice, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid "Well thanks... but I wanted you to look at my hair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "You really don't listen to people, do ya, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid "I try to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever. I do have my nails done up real nice at the salon. I like "
"bein' all dolled up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid "Your hair is nice, but your legs are beautiful beyond compare..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "Aww... I wanted ya to look at my hair, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid "You really don't listen to people, do ya, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "I don't...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520"
msgid ""
"I know you've been lookin' at my legs the whole time too. You're hopeless, "
"man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532"
msgid "I think your hair is perfect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid ""
"Right!? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I even got a live flower in there! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Ahh, I just love the way it turned out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "It definitely suits you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid ""
"Thanks! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I love it when I have a good hair day! "
"Which is, like, pretty much all the time. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1580"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Was I not just talkin' about my hair, like, seconds ago?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "Yeah... You were..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "Were you even listening to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1616"
msgid "...I thought I was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1628"
msgid "I give up. From now on, I won't talk about myself anymore. Happy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1640"
msgid "You spacin' out on me or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1652"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1664"
msgid "Come on... I wanted ya to look at my hair."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1676"
msgid "You really don't listen to people, do ya, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1688"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

